      },
      "text": "Many folks believe there’s a smooth continuum between good people and great people.\n\nIn my experience, there’s a huge “band gap” between good and great.\n\nGreat people are clever, determined, fight hard, more loyal in hardship, and strategic.\n\nIt is obvious when someone is great.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1188858580579115013"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-10-26T21:36:27.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1188207788838866950"
