        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "text": "Have spent 2 hrs today waiting at the hospital and on hold for @BankofAmerica \n\nExtremely frustrated by poor capacity planning. Why are they not more savvy?",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1186341078158344192"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-10-20T21:20:29.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1186029445192110080"
