      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 76,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 422,
        "quote_count": 4,
        "reply_count": 5,
        "retweet_count": 65
      },
      "text": "How to build something insanely great:\n\n1. Build something you care about.\n2. Find users. Listen to them.\n3. Improve it every single day.\n4. Find people who inspire you and convince them to work with you.\n5. Repeat 2-4 for years.\n\nJust 5 simple steps.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1186029445192110080"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-10-16T03:54:51.000Z",
