        "like_count": 35,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 3
      },
      "text": "Unofficial information always travels faster than official information.\n\nUnofficial info is juicier, so each person is more likely to spread it.\n\nUnfortunately, juicy information is generally incorrect. Most facts are boring and not worth spreading.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1184316750537490432"
    },
