      "text": "Real interaction:\n\nMe: “Hey, we’ve met briefly, but I work with X on your team.”\n\nVC @ a firm invested in Scale: “Cool, what do you do?”\n\nMe: “We do data labeling for AI”\n\nVC: “Oh I’m surprised we invested. We have a company Scale that’s killing it.”\n\nMe: 🤨",
