      "text": "Simple truth: your biggest strength is usually also your biggest weakness.\n\nDon’t fool yourself. Moving fast is not purely good, for example.\n\nIt’s one reason to hire for strengths rather than lack of weakness. Lack of weakness usually means lack of strength.",
